    "updated_at": "2020-03-30T06:42:44Z",
    "body": "@filipemendespi I found the solution! It is an issue with how Fish now handles locales since 3.1, will be fixed in 3.1.1: https://github.com/fish-shell/fish-shell/issues/6736\r\nTo fix, you need to set `LANG=en_US.UTF-8`, or other locale that is not `C`",
